Package: tiktokx
Name: TikTokX
Version: 1.0.52
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Background play and hands-free scrolling for TikTok.
 Listen to TikTok with the screen locked, let the feed move on by itself and
 scroll it from the lock screen - with a clean, distraction-free video view
 when you want one.
 .
 Features:
  - Keep audio playing when you leave TikTok or lock the screen
  - Move to the next video automatically when one finishes
  - Turn the lock screen and Control Center skip buttons into previous/next
  - Hide buttons, captions and overlays, tap the video to show them again
  - TikTok fits the car screen when shown on CarPlay with CarBridge
  - Settings in English or Vietnamese
 .
 Set it up in Settings > TikTokX. Changes apply right away, no respring needed.
 .
 Compatibility: iOS 15 and later, rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine, palera1n).
Maintainer: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Author: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.anlai.tiktokx, com.tiktokx
Replaces: com.anlai.tiktokx, com.tiktokx
Icon: file:///var/jb/Library/TikTokX/icon.png
